    description: "Instead of building an estimate bottom-up from your specific plan (the 'inside view'), anchor on the distribution of outcomes from a reference class of similar past cases, then adjust. Kahneman & Lovallo argued the inside view drives systematic optimism; Flyvbjerg operationalized reference-class forecasting for infrastructure, where inside-view forecasts show chronic cost overruns (rail ~40%+, dams ~90%+).",
