    id: "emotional-reasoning-anxiety-maintenance", section: "946", title: "Emotional Reasoning (Ex-Consequentia) → Anxiety Maintenance", subtitle: "Degrades: Meta-Cognitive, Emotional, Interoceptive, Logical",
